{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/988547-demonic-roll-call","id":988547,"title":"Demonic Roll Call","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-16T18:19:10-07:00","id":988547,"title":"Demonic Roll Call","content":"Just thought it would be cool to kind of list the types of Demons in CoD 2e.<br /> <br /> Unchained<br /> Supernal Demons<br /> Oneiron Succubi<br /> Cambions<br /> Lucifuge aren't out yet, but they will be in Hunter 2e, safe bet.<br /> Darklings of the Dearheart Kith<br /> Onierons Incubi (barely)<br /> <br /> Denizens of the Lowers depths maybe?<br /> <br /> I don't know about Werewolf and Promeathan<br /> <br /> It appears demons are rarer in 2e then 1e.<br /> <br /> Goetic demons are just Goetics now.<br /> Inferno 2e isn't out, just fanon stuff.<br /> <br /> No real stuff on Belial's Brood or Bale Hounds yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T18:59:47-07:00","id":988577,"title":"","content":"Many Lucifuge categorise GM-Angels as &quot;demons&quot;.<br /> Dark Eras has Dust Devils and &quot;The Traveling Salesman&quot; who &quot;might&quot; be a demon.<br /> <br /> I'd say &quot;Faith&quot; spirits formed from demon worshipping cults would be easily considered demons.<br /> Geotia that represent demons (The geotia of the Devil would probably be rather high rank in the modern day).<br /> Murder/lust/wrath/gluttony/etc. spirits<br /> There are probably tonnes of demon horrors.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Lucifuge aren't out yet, but they will be in Hunter 2e, safe bet. </div> </div> </div>They're in 2e already via Mortal Remains.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T19:18:02-07:00","id":988588,"title":"","content":"The Hunter 1e core mentions that Lucifuge Castigations that target &quot;demons&quot; consider basically anything of an otherworldly ephemeral origin to be demons.<br /> <br /> There are the (possibly Abyssal) manifestations of the Knights of Saint George's Goetic Gospels.<br /> <br /> The Celebrants from The God-Machine Chronicle, who are demons in the Hellraiser style.<br /> <br /> The Maeljin Incarna, lords of the Wounds from Werewolf, have been strongly hinted to be manifestations of the Inferno.<br /> <br /> We don't know much about the demons native to the Duat to which the Deathless return, but they're out there, probably.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.co